    "Prior C startup, zlib, full native rustc compilation and proc macros continue passing"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "SQLite native VFS is single-threaded, serializes readers, uses rollback journals, memory temp storage; no WAL/mmap/loadable extensions; not standard Unix VFS or full SQLite test suite",
    "flock acquisition requires LOCK_NB; tmpfs/ext2 only; unsupported FS rejected",
    "ext2 last-link unlink while open returns EBUSY; directory deletion returns EOPNOTSUPP (nonempty ENOTEMPTY), pending full retained-node lifetime",
